      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "UnitEffect": "RADIOS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여기는 연락관 리사.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こちら連絡官、リサ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_NPC_NOA_LISA_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 49,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "UnitEffect": "RADIOS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아, 보이저 구원단 분들이군요. 디랙의 우물에 도착하셨나 보죠?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あ、ボイジャー救援団の方々ですね。ディラックの井戸に到着されたのですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_NPC_NOA_LISA_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 50,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "UnitEffect": "RADIOS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "다행이에요. 조금만 더 늦었으면 여기도 무사하지 못했을 테니까요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "よかったです。もう少し遅かったら、こちらも危ないところでした。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_NPC_NOA_LISA_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 51,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_VOYAGER_ORACLE",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아스트로 생텀도 지키지 못할 정도라고?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "アストロ・サンクタムも守れないくらいなの？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_UNIT_S_VOYAGER_ORACLE_021.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 52,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_VOYAGER_ORACLE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "대체 상황이 얼마나 심각한 거야?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どんだけ深刻な状況なのよ？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_UNIT_S_VOYAGER_ORACLE_022.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 53,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_5",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitEffect": "RADIOS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "NOA 시내 절반 이상이 <color=#F7BE45>[공허균열]</color>화 되었어요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "NOA市内の半分以上が<color=#F7BE45>「空虚の亀裂」</color>と化しました。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_NPC_NOA_LISA_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 54,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "UnitEffect": "RADIOS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그곳으로부터  <color=#F7BE45>[백작급]</color> 이상의 공허체들이 쏟아져 나오고 있고요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そこから<color=#F7BE45>「アール級」</color>以上の<r=ヴォイドボーン>空虚体</r>たちが溢れ出ています。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_END_STARLIGHT_01_NPC_NOA_LISA_005.wav"
    },
    {
